  "excerpt": "Spiced pear tart is a blind-baked shortcrust case filled with almond cream and topped with poached pear halves. The pears are poached in spiced syrup first until tender, which gives them a deep flavour the oven alone would not produce. The almond cream base is dense and moist and bakes around the pears. A spiced pear version of the classic pear frangipane tart.",
