    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Spiced pear tart is built in three stages: poach the pears in spiced syrup, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blind-baking"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "blind-bake"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " the pastry case, then fill with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "frangipane"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "frangipane"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and bake with the pears on top. Poaching the pears ahead gives them the spice flavour and ensures they are fully tender through the baking time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For the poached pears"
